													<span class="dashboard-appointments-count whitespace-nowrap rounded-full bg-[#E8EAED] dark:bg-[#2B2D31] px-3 py-1.5 text-[0.75rem] font-black text-[#5f6368] dark:text-[#C4C7C5] tracking-wide shadow-sm transition-colors duration-300">
														{appointmentsCountText}
